  "sourceText": "Summer Ratatouille\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 11:12pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 tablespoons Olive oil\n1 cup Peeled, diced eggplant\ncup Chopped onions\ncup Diced yellow squash\ncup Diced zucchini\ncup Peeled, seeded, chopped tomatoes\ncup Fresh whole kernel corn - (1 ear of corn)\ncup Chopped fresh basil\n2 tablespoons Minced garlic\n1 teaspoon Salt\nFreshly-ground black pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Heat oil in a large skillet and add all ingredients and 4 turns pepper. Stir-fry, stirring constantly, 3 minutes.",
